{"id": "3326728", "name": "אינטגרלים משולשים – מסה של טטראהדרון", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "none", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 2, "questiontext": "<div title=\"BGU_STACK_CALC2_POLISHED_V1\" dir=\"rtl\" style=\"width:100%;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#1f2937;line-height:1.65;text-align:right;\">\n\n  <div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:16px 18px;margin-bottom:14px;\">\n    <div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:bold;color:#4B1F6F;\">מסה של טטראהדרון באמצעות אינטגרל משולש</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"background:#fff;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:16px 18px;margin-bottom:14px;\">\n    <div>נתון הטטראהדרון שקודקודיו</div>\n\n    <div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center;font-size:18px;margin:8px 0;\">\n      \\(\\displaystyle\n      (0,0,0),\\\n      ({{CT:0}},0,0),\\\n      (0,{{CT:1}},0),\\\n      (0,0,{{CT:2}})\n      \\)\n    </div>\n\n    <div>צפיפות המסה היא</div>\n\n    <div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center;font-size:19px;margin:8px 0;\">\n      \\(\\displaystyle\n      \\rho(x,y,z)={{CT:3}}\n      \\)\n    </div>\n\n    <div>\n      כתבו את המסה כאינטגרל בסדר\n      <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle dz\\,dy\\,dx\\)</span>\n      בצורה\n    </div>\n\n    <div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center;font-size:18px;margin:8px 0;\">\n      \\(\\displaystyle\n      M=\n      \\int_a^b\n      \\int_0^{c(x)}\n      \\int_0^{d(x,y)}\n      \\rho(x,y,z)\\,dz\\,dy\\,dx\n      \\)\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"background:#fff;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:16px 18px;margin-bottom:14px;\">\n    <div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4B1F6F;margin-bottom:10px;\">גבולות האינטגרציה</div>\n\n    <div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(230px,340px));gap:12px;justify-content:center;align-items:start;margin-bottom:12px;\">\n      <div style=\"background:#F8F7F9;border:1px solid #E4DEE7;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 14px;\">\n        <div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:8px;white-space:nowrap;\">\n          <span>\\(\\displaystyle a=\\)</span>[[input:ans1]]\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#665f6b;margin-top:5px;\">[[validation:ans1]]</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div style=\"background:#F8F7F9;border:1px solid #E4DEE7;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 14px;\">\n        <div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:8px;white-space:nowrap;\">\n          <span>\\(\\displaystyle b=\\)</span>[[input:ans2]]\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#665f6b;margin-top:5px;\">[[validation:ans2]]</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(280px,420px));gap:12px;justify-content:center;align-items:start;\">\n      <div style=\"background:#F8F7F9;border:1px solid #E4DEE7;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 14px;\">\n        <div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:8px;white-space:nowrap;\">\n          <span>\\(\\displaystyle c(x)=\\)</span>[[input:ans3]]\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#665f6b;margin-top:5px;\">[[validation:ans3]]</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div style=\"background:#F8F7F9;border:1px solid #E4DEE7;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 14px;\">\n        <div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:8px;white-space:nowrap;\">\n          <span>\\(\\displaystyle d(x,y)=\\)</span>[[input:ans4]]\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#665f6b;margin-top:5px;\">[[validation:ans4]]</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div style=\"max-width:320px;margin:12px auto 0;background:#F8F7F9;border:1px solid #E4DEE7;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 14px;\">\n      <div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:8px;white-space:nowrap;\">\n        <span>\\(\\displaystyle M=\\)</span>[[input:ans5]]\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#665f6b;margin-top:5px;\">[[validation:ans5]]</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"width: 100%; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color: #1f2937; line-height: 1.65; text-align: right;\" title=\"BGU_STACK_CALC2_Q7_REPAIR6_V1\">\n<div style=\"background: #F4F1F5; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 14px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f;\">פתרון מלא</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 14px;\">\n<p>משוואת המישור העובר בשלושת חיתוכי הצירים היא</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\\(\\displaystyle \\frac{x}{{{CT:0}}}+\\frac{y}{{{CT:1}}}+\\frac{z}{{{CT:2}}}=1\\)</div>\n<p>לכן</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\\(\\displaystyle 0\\le x\\le{{CT:0}},\\qquad0\\le y\\le{{CT:4}},\\qquad0\\le z\\le{{CT:5}}\\)</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 17px; margin-top: 8px;\">\\(\\displaystyle M=\\int_0^{{{CT:0}}}\\int_0^{{{CT:4}}}\\int_0^{{{CT:5}}}{{CT:3}}\\,dz\\,dy\\,dx={{CT:6}}\\)</div>\n</div>\n</div>", "specificfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">[[feedback:prt1]] [[feedback:prt2]]</div>", "prtcorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"correct\">תשובה נכונה.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"partially\">חלק מן התשובה נכון. בדקו את שאר הרכיבים.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"incorrect\">התשובה עדיין אינה נכונה.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 6, "insertstars": 1, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allo